        "We are acquiring Duolingo (DUOL) at a $2.4B enterprise value, implying a 12.0x entry EV/EBITDA multiple \u2014 a disciplined entry point for a category-defining consumer SaaS asset with durable subscription revenue. Sponsor equity of $1.6B finances the transaction alongside 4.0x debt/EBITDA leverage, leaving meaningful balance-sheet capacity to execute growth initiatives. The base case targets a 3.52x MOIC and 28.6% IRR, clearing our hurdle rate with room to absorb execution variance."
